I've actually done[ this] somehow[ on Disk] Utility several times ([b]ooting[ from a different] drive ([or even] the dvd) so not running disk utility from the[ drive] your cloning) and had it work just fine from larger to smaller bootable clone. Definitely format the drive cloning to[ first], as bootable Apple etc..
